t)=\\cos\\left(225^\\circ+30^\\circ\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(225^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(30^\\circ\\right)-\\sin\\left(225^\\circ\\right)\\sin\\left(30^\\circ\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}-\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{- \\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "4fc9ef0c-fb5d-5d39-bbec-ab1af2cf98bc" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "4fc9ef0c-fb5d-5d39-bbec-ab1af2cf98bc" :question/answer-fields "2d736977-2893-51e6-a663-0615508617b3"] [:db/ensure "4fc9ef0c-fb5d-5d39-bbec-ab1af2cf98bc" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/questions "4fc9ef0c-fb5d-5d39-bbec-ab1af2cf98bc"] [:db/add "8c5c3450-d1e5-552e-8227-989879635ea6" :answer/id #uuid "8c5c3450-d1e5-552e-8227-989879635ea6"] [:db/add "8c5c3450-d1e5-552e-8227-989879635ea6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8c5c3450-d1e5-552e-8227-989879635ea6" :answer/value "\\frac{- \\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "8c5c3450-d1e5-552e-8227-989879635ea6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097" :answer-field/id #uuid "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097"] [:db/add "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097" :answer-field/choices "8c5c3450-d1e5-552e-8227-989879635ea6"] [:db/add "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097" :answer-field/correct "8c5c3450-d1e5-552e-8227-989879635ea6"] [:db/ensure "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1" :question/id #uuid "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1"] [:db/add "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1" :question/problem "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n105^\\circ=240^\\circ-135^\\circ,\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(105^\\circ\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(105^\\circ\\right)=$ {{field-1}}"] [:db/add "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(105^\\circ\\right)=\\cos\\left(240^\\circ-135^\\circ\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(240^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(135^\\circ\\right)+\\sin\\left(240^\\circ\\right)\\sin\\left(135^\\circ\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{- \\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1" :question/answer-fields "2ac3b95d-427a-5a44-a5e3-1e6c55842097"] [:db/ensure "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/questions "014e904c-4ac0-5d05-ae04-396c1677c3b1"] [:db/add "0df03d40-dfc0-549e-8d10-3c89b078b29b" :answer/id #uuid "0df03d40-dfc0-549e-8d10-3c89b078b29b"] [:db/add "0df03d40-dfc0-549e-8d10-3c89b078b29b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0df03d40-dfc0-549e-8d10-3c89b078b29b" :answer/value "\\frac{- \\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "0df03d40-dfc0-549e-8d10-3c89b078b29b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441" :answer-field/id #uuid "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441"] [:db/add "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441" :answer-field/choices "0df03d40-dfc0-549e-8d10-3c89b078b29b"] [:db/add "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441" :answer-field/correct "0df03d40-dfc0-549e-8d10-3c89b078b29b"] [:db/ensure "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25" :question/id #uuid "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25"] [:db/add "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25" :question/problem "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n\\frac{17\\pi}{12}=\\frac{3\\pi}{4}+\\frac{2\\pi}{3},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(\\frac{17\\pi}{12}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(\\frac{17\\pi}{12}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}"] [:db/add "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25" :question/worked-solution "Recall the sum formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x+y)=\\cos x\\cos y-\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{17\\pi}{12}\\right)=\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}+\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)-\\sin\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4} \\\\\n&=\\frac{- \\sqrt{6} + \\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25" :question/answer-fields "e7cdacdf-9b4e-5f44-af91-467135a1e441"] [:db/ensure "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/questions "a3594bde-81e0-5a40-85cd-984ec5434e25"] [:db/add "f9aa45a1-9a38-576a-8d4d-2838200c247c" :answer/id #uuid "f9aa45a1-9a38-576a-8d4d-2838200c247c"] [:db/add "f9aa45a1-9a38-576a-8d4d-2838200c247c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f9aa45a1-9a38-576a-8d4d-2838200c247c" :answer/value "\\frac{- \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "f9aa45a1-9a38-576a-8d4d-2838200c247c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85" :answer-field/id #uuid "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85"] [:db/add "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85" :answer-field/choices "f9aa45a1-9a38-576a-8d4d-2838200c247c"] [:db/add "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85" :answer-field/correct "f9aa45a1-9a38-576a-8d4d-2838200c247c"] [:db/ensure "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1" :question/id #uuid "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1"] [:db/add "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1" :question/problem "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n-75^\\circ=45^\\circ-120^\\circ,\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(-75^\\circ\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(-75^\\circ\\right)=$ {{field-1}}"] [:db/add "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-75^\\circ\\right)=\\cos\\left(45^\\circ-120^\\circ\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(45^\\circ\\right)\\cos\\left(120^\\circ\\right)+\\sin\\left(45^\\circ\\right)\\sin\\left(120^\\circ\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right)+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right)+\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4} \\\\\n&=\\frac{- \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1" :question/answer-fields "0d0584aa-aff0-5498-967d-369a9fcfcf85"] [:db/ensure "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/questions "79666e9c-2f88-5b52-bd7c-67da11dc25a1"] [:db/add "3543ed55-fff1-5697-be0a-011afcd150f6" :answer/id #uuid "3543ed55-fff1-5697-be0a-011afcd150f6"] [:db/add "3543ed55-fff1-5697-be0a-011afcd150f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3543ed55-fff1-5697-be0a-011afcd150f6" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "3543ed55-fff1-5697-be0a-011afcd150f6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1"] [:db/add "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1" :answer-field/choices "3543ed55-fff1-5697-be0a-011afcd150f6"] [:db/add "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1" :answer-field/correct "3543ed55-fff1-5697-be0a-011afcd150f6"] [:db/ensure "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df" :question/id #uuid "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df"] [:db/add "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df" :question/problem "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n\\frac{23\\pi}{12}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\frac{7\\pi}{4},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(\\frac{23\\pi}{12}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(\\frac{23\\pi}{12}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}"] [:db/add "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df" :question/worked-solution "Recall the sum formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x+y)=\\cos x\\cos y-\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{23\\pi}{12}\\right)=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}+\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}-\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df" :question/answer-fields "1896ea3c-1d20-5c06-bfaf-b0a6968788a1"] [:db/ensure "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/questions "1445f9a4-ddce-59b1-855c-0727569a68df"] [:db/add "554e161c-c2da-55d5-bbd0-6999bf4c663b" :answer/id #uuid "554e161c-c2da-55d5-bbd0-6999bf4c663b"] [:db/add "554e161c-c2da-55d5-bbd0-6999bf4c663b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "554e161c-c2da-55d5-bbd0-6999bf4c663b" :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}"] [:db/ensure "554e161c-c2da-55d5-bbd0-6999bf4c663b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98" :answer-field/id #uuid "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98"] [:db/add "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98" :answer-field/choices "554e161c-c2da-55d5-bbd0-6999bf4c663b"] [:db/add "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98" :answer-field/correct "554e161c-c2da-55d5-bbd0-6999bf4c663b"] [:db/ensure "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6" :question/id #uuid "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6"] [:db/add "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6" :question/problem "Using the fact that\n\n$$\n-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{7\\pi}{6},\n$$\n\ncalculate the **exact** value of $\\cos\\left(-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)$.\n\n$\\cos\\left(-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)=$ {{field-1}}"] [:db/add "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-\\frac{11\\pi}{12}\\right)=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{6}\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}\\right)+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6" :question/answer-fields "03b9b630-0b80-5314-b540-772b35d14a98"] [:db/ensure "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/questions "f33fad89-1bf5-5863-a27a-cf99ad3f26e6"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "000b985d-474b-5ecb-94a1-4befd443a0d2"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/11/11f5405dce86981ef8d18c16d69f8bf1925924e54e1966bac413aac8c2d4c2e6/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186059666 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186714819 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186714820 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186714827 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186715276 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186715280 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186715282 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186715288 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186715293 :question/retired nil true] 